    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***To bid on this property register on MySherryFitz.ie***\n\nSherry Fitzgerald Brady O'Flaherty are delighted to introduce 9 Fairgreen Court to the market, a wonderfully presented, three-bedroom mid terrace house, discreetly tucked away in this secure gated complex, right in the heart of Kilcock, opposite the Rail Station & Royal Canal Greenway, and all amenities on your doorstep. Fairgreen Court itself is an attractive collection of 21 homes, with ample parking and landscaped grounds, all expertly managed. \n\nExtending to a generous 93sqm / 1,005 sq.ft, offering bright, light filled accommodation and further enhanced by a lovely private south facing rear garden. Accommodation includes; welcoming hallway with guest WC, nicely appointed living room with double doors through to open plan kitchen / dining room which opens onto rear garden. While on the first floor, there are 3 fine sized bedrooms & family bathroom. \n\nThe convenience and desirability of the location cannot be overstated. The town has experienced tremendous growth in recent years both in terms of residential and commercial development. The M4 motorway is also easily accessible while the university town of Maynooth is a mere 10-minute drive. \n\nGiven it's location and type, this home is going to have strong appeal among first time buyers and 'right-sizers' in particular. Warmly decorated throughout in bright colours, no. 9 comes to market in truly 'turn-key' condition and immediate viewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.45m x 2.61m\nWith timber laminate flooring, Guest WC & understairs storage off same.\n\nGuest WC - 1.39m x 1.45m\n\n\nLiving Room - 3.29m x 5.00m\nWith timber laminate flooring, feature gas fireplace with surrounding hearth. Ample shelving & storage.\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 2.65m x 6.16m\nBright, open plan room, with fitted kitchen incorporating good quality appliances & timber flooring. French doors leading to rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - 1.49m x 1.45m\nWith timber laminate flooring, fitted units & plumbed for washer/dryer. External door to rear garden.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.29m x 3.75m\nDouble bedroom with timber laminate flooring and fitted wardrobes. Overlooking lovely open green to front.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.65m x 3.75m\nDouble bedroom with timber laminate flooring & fitted wardrobes. Overlooking sunny rear garden.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.29m x 2.50m\nWith timber flooring.\n\nBathroom - 1.49m x 2.50m\nUpgraded bathroom suite featuring attractive dark textured wall tiles. Electric shower over bath, toilet & whb.\n\nOutside - \nOverlooking a large recreational green space to front. Large, West facing rear garden laid in lawn.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Special Features:</li><li>Unrivalled town centre location</li><li>Opposite Rail Station & Royal Canal Greenway </li><li>Beautifully presented throughout </li><li>Delightful sunny aspect </li><li>GFCH </li><li>Generous room proportions </li><li>Private, gated complex</li><li>All amenities and services on your doorstep </li><li>Less than 10 minute's drive from university town of Maynooth </li><li>Annual Management Fee 1,800 </li><li>Blinds, light fittings & kitchen appliances included in sale</ul>"
      },
